title mmWave Radar: tall Radar page (480x800, the Pi 3A+ DSI): plot, target list and strip chart, one person, Metres then Millimetres
sizes 480x800
env MMWAVE_DEMO walk
env MMWAVE_TEST_CONFIG 1

wait 3500
shot tall-one
check tall-one
expect text "Radar"
expect notext "No radar found"
key 4
wait 500
key down
wait 200
key enter
wait 300
expect text "Millimetres"
key 1
wait 1200
shot tall-one-mm
check tall-one-mm
expect noquit
